<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE PROMOTION PLAY-OFF RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE PROMOTION PLAY-OFF RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of semifinal, second leg</p>
<p>matches in English league promotion play-offs on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Division one</p>
<p> Ipswich	  2  Sheffield United  2</p>
<p>(Aggregate 3-3 - extra time being played)</p>
<p> Wolverhampton  2  Crystal Palace    1</p>
<p>(Crystal Palace win 4-3 on aggregate)</p>
<p>Division two</p>
<p> Brentford	2  Bristol City	1</p>
<p>(Brentford win 4-2)</p>
<p> Luton	    2  Crewe		 2</p>
<p>(Crewe win 4-3)</p>
<p>Division three</p>
<p> Northampton    3  Cardiff	     2</p>
<p>(Northampton win 4-2)</p>
<p> Swansea	  3  Chester	     0</p>
<p>(Swansea win 3-0)</p>
</text>
